# Dress Down is on the battlefield before Extinguisher Battleship enters (its trigger destroys Bot1's tapped Mox Jet and the 4 damage
# leaves Gigantosaurus alive) and is stationed with Bot1's Gigantosaurus (10 power). Ten charge counters turn on "5+": the type
# change, flying and trample and the 10/10 are one static ability whose effect began in layer 4, so its layer 6 and 7b parts keep
# applying although Dress Down, earlier in layer 6, took the abilities of every creature - a 10/10 artifact creature with flying and
# trample (CR 613.6, 721.2b).

